=1731314842\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Soon, you will uncover your special gift: the language of children \u2013 Minortongue, which remains with you even after mastering Elderspeech. Delve into the mysteries of the Monolith, where the souls of departed children seem to linger on in the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
